G WITH EXECUTIVE SEARCH FIRM TO IDENTIFY, EVALUATE CANDIDATES TO ASSUME ROLE OF CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER."}{'symbol': 'NTAP', 'date': '2020-02-13 19:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Netapp Reports Third Quarter Of Fiscal Year 2020 Results', 'text': 'NETAPP REPORTS THIRD QUARTER OF FISCAL YEAR 2020 RESULTS.Q3 REVENUE $1.4 BILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $1.46 BILLION.Q3 GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.21.SEES FY 2020 REVENUE DOWN ABOUT 10 PERCENT.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $1.18 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.Q3 NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.16.SEES Q4 2020 REVENUE $1.455 BILLION TO $1.605 BILLION.SEES Q4 2020 NON GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.28 TO $1.36.SEES Q4 EARNINGS PER SHARE $01.11 - $1.19.Q4 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $1.39, REVENUE VIEW $1.57 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.FY NET REVENUES ARE EXPECTED TO DECLINE APPROXIMATELY 10% YEAR-OVER-YEAR.FY GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE EXPECTED TO DECLINE APPROXIMATELY 16% YEAR-OVER-YEAR.FY NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE EXPECTED TO DECLINE APPROXIMATELY 7% YEAR-OVER-YEAR.FY2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $4.30, REVENUE VIEW $5.64 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.FY GAAP CONSOLIDATED GROSS MARGINS ARE EXPECTED TO BE IN RANGE OF 66% - 67%.FY NON-GAAP CONSOLIDATED GROSS MARGINS ARE EXPECTED TO BE IN RANGE OF 67% - 68%.'}{'symbol': 'POOL', 'date': '2020-02-13 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Pool Posts Q4 Earnings Per Share Of $0.44', 'text': 'ORATION REPORTS RECORD 2019 RESULTS AND PROVIDES 2020 EARNINGS GUIDANCE.Q4 SALES $582.2 MILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $581.9 MILLION.SEES FY 2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE $6.47 TO $6.77 INCLUDING ITEMS.Q4 EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.44.Q4 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $0.36 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.EXPECT EARNINGS FOR 2020 WILL BE IN RANGE OF $6.47 TO $6.77 PER DILUTED SHARE.'}{'symbol': 'POOL', 'date': '2020-02-13 22:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Pool Posts Q4 Earnings Per Share Of $0.44', 'text': 'Feb 13  - Pool Corp <POOL.O>::ORATION REPORTS RECORD 2019 RESULTS AND PROVIDES 2020 EARNINGS GUIDANCE.Q4 SALES $582.2 MILLION 